  help_android_notification_mirroring_toggle: "Send app notifications to your desktop. Off by default.",
  help_android_phone_read: "Best effort. Messages you read in your phone's messaging app are marked read in Peppy, including after time away. SMS always counts; MMS counts when MMS sync is on. This needs SMS sync and SMS read access. Reading an SMS in Peppy can also mark it read on your phone, which needs notification access and Android 9 or later. Peppy never marks messages unread. This setting covers SMS and MMS only. It does not track RCS conversations in your messaging app. When marking SMS read on your phone, Peppy skips ambiguous or unseen conversations, and pending phone attempts expire after one day.",
